{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284260","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284260","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1028426001:1":{"text":"……誰だ！？","source_cn":"……你们是谁？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x067D78997DF6F380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028426002:1":{"text":"私はヴィジランツのライカです。あなたたちは採集部隊のキャンプにいた植物学者さんですか？","source_cn":"我是薄暮巡游队的莱卡，你们是从采集队营地出发的那两位植...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23A1026BDFEBA05F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028426003:1":{"text":"まあ……お連れの方が地面に倒れているではありませんか！？大丈夫ですか！？","source_cn":"咦……为什么你的同伴躺在地上？！他没事吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50ED6947706EEFAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028426004:1":{"text":"ヴィ……ヴィジランツか。ああ、彼は……恐怖のあまり……そ、そうだ。恐怖のあまり気絶してしまったんだ！","source_cn":"巡……巡游队啊，哦，对，他是……吓坏了！对，吓晕了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x117CBD2035D8FCB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028426005:1":{"text":"魔物に追いかけられて、ここに逃げてきて……そうだ。それで……彼が気絶してしまったんだ！","source_cn":"外面有魔物追击，我们一路逃……对，然后他……他就晕过去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BBFA9B907E4B107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028426006:1":{"text":"大丈夫ですか？話し方がしどろもどろですけど……","source_cn":"你不舒服吗？为什么结结巴巴的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF90206FE20CB5372","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028426007:1":{"text":"ちょ……ゴホッ！ちょっと具合が悪くて……ゴホゴホッ！","source_cn":"我……咳，我是有点不舒服……咳咳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x985866C74FADD6FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028426008:1":{"text":"気を失ってどのくらい経ちましたか？私たちにできることはありますか？","source_cn":"你的同伴晕过去多久了？需要我们帮忙吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF08250B31378A4E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028426009:1":{"text":"えっ？いや。ない。大丈夫だ……彼もそのうち目を覚ますだろう……","source_cn":"啊？哦，不，没事……他……他应该过一会就能醒过来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33C39E02083395F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1028426009":{"text":"えっ？いや。ない。大丈夫だ……彼もそのうち目を覚ますだろう……","source_cn":"啊？哦，不，没事……他……他应该过一会就能醒过来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33C39E02083395F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028426010:1":{"text":"あのう、何があったのか、もう少し詳しく教えていただきたいのですが……","source_cn":"先生，我想再多了解一下你们之前遇到的状况……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B5A96256AAC8582","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1028426011:1":{"text":"ライカと植物学者が話をしている隙に、ロンロンは洞窟の壁の陰に隠れながら、こっそりと机のそばへと移動した。","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6C76B245353397F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028426012:1":{"text":"これは……マスター、持ってきました！見てください！","source_cn":"这是……主人，我拿回来了，你们看！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x43790CD8109A0589","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"これは……マスター、持ってきました！見てください！","female":"これは……マスター、持ってきました！見てください！","variant_male_record_index":"113311","variant_female_record_index":"113312","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028426013:1":{"text":"――おい！そこの薄汚いネズミ！僕の物に触るな！","source_cn":"——喂！肮脏的耗子！别碰我的东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A4076C5428AADCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028426014:1":{"text":"これは……採集部隊が村に送った、助けを求める手紙ではありませんか？","source_cn":"这是……采集队写给村子的求助信？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC2757D58F9C0EF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028426015:1":{"text":"どうして……勝手に手紙の封を開けたのですか！？","source_cn":"你们……你为什么私自把信拆开了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2FC5526D13B6AC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028426016:0":{"text":"それに、この方はどうして倒れているですか？正直に答えてください！","source_cn":"你的同伴到底是怎么昏倒的，请诚实地回答！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C805C1FD901565B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028426017:1":{"text":"ふん……ごまかしきれると思ってたのに。面倒な奴らだな！","source_cn":"哼……本来还想着能应付过去的，你们这些人真是麻烦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0BE7F1A1F94A03B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028426018:1":{"text":"あれこれと聞いてきたお前らが悪いんだからな――","source_cn":"非要问那么多问题，这只能怪你们自己——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7A01E6088AFFADA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1028426019:1":{"text":"余計なことしやがって！","source_cn":"多此一举！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE1E0A886795C10C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1028426020:1":{"text":"マズい！魔物に囲まれてしまった……！","source_cn":"糟了，周围有魔物围过来了……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62F8F1ED3E44603C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1028426021:1":{"text":"マスター、気をつけてください！","source_cn":"主人，小心！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7F3D026858902BF4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスター、気をつけてください！","female":"マスター、気をつけてください！","variant_male_record_index":"113321","variant_female_record_index":"113322","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"怪しいところは少しもないな。","source_cn":"真是一点也不可疑呢","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBA91896338E0A3FA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"怪しいところは少しもないな。","female":"怪しいところは少しもないな。","variant_male_record_index":"61872","variant_female_record_index":"61873","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"（調べるようにとロンロンに合図を送る）","source_cn":"（暗示满满去调查）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7BF11DE254D69480","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"（調べるようにとロンロンに合図を送る）","female":"（調べるようにとロンロンに合図を送る）","variant_male_record_index":"61874","variant_female_record_index":"61875","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:“植物学家”瓦西里":{"text":"植物学者のヴァシリー","source":"“植物学家”瓦西里","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"ライカ","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":4}}